{"seq":1,"slug":"prophet-automated-forecasting","title":"Prophet 与自动化预测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/time-series-analysis/modern-methods/prophet-automated-forecasting","wordCount":1171,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"prophet-与自动化预测\">Prophet 与自动化预测</h1><p>2017 年 Facebook（现 Meta）开源的 Prophet 改变了时间序列预测的工作方式：它用可分解加法模型（趋势 + 季节 + 节假日 + 回归项）替代 Box-Jenkins 范式，让不具备统计学背景的分析师也能产出合理预测。本文覆盖 Prophet 的模型结构、参数调优策略，以及 2026 年围绕它形成的 Nixtla 自动化预测生态——StatsForecast、NeuralForecast 和 MLForecast 构成的统一管线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Prophet 用可分解加法模型（趋势+季节+节假日）替代 Box-Jenkins 的差分-ARMA 范式，将预测从统计学家的技能推广到业务分析师的日常工具。Nixtla 生态（StatsForecast / NeuralForecast / MLForecast / TimeGPT）进一步将&quot;统一接口 + 多方法竞争 + 自动选择&quot;的管线工业化，实现百万级序列的分钟级预测。</p>\n<h2 id=\"prophet-模型结构\">Prophet 模型结构</h2><p>Prophet 将观测值分解为四个加法成分：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>ε</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y(t) = g(t) + s(t) + h(t) + \\varepsilon_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>：趋势函数（增长曲线）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>：周期性季节成分（傅里叶级数）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>：节假日/事件效应</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ε</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：不可约噪声</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"趋势模型\">趋势模型</h3><p><strong>分段线性趋势</strong>（默认）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>T</mi></msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>T</mi></msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">γ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g(t) = (k + \\mathbf{a}(t)^T \\boldsymbol{\\delta}) t + (m + \\mathbf{a}(t)^T \\boldsymbol{\\gamma})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1413em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">a</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\" style=\"margin-right:0.0382em;\">δ</span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1413em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">a</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\" style=\"margin-right:0.0639em;\">γ</span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 为基础增长率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol{\\delta}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\" style=\"margin-right:0.0382em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为各变点处的斜率变化量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{a}(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">a</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 为变点指示向量。Prophet 自动在历史数据中检测 25 个候选变点（默认），通过对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol{\\delta}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\" style=\"margin-right:0.0382em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 施加 Laplace 先验实现稀疏化。</p>\n<p><strong>饱和增长趋势</strong>（逻辑斯谛）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>T</mi></msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>T</mi></msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">γ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g(t) = \\frac{C(t)}{1 + \\exp(-(k + \\mathbf{a}(t)^T\\boldsymbol{\\delta})(t - (m + \\mathbf{a}(t)^T\\boldsymbol{\\gamma})))}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">a</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7673em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\" style=\"margin-right:0.0382em;\">δ</span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">a</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7673em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\" style=\"margin-right:0.0639em;\">γ</span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)))</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 为时变容量上限，适用于有天花板的增长场景（如市场渗透率）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"季节性建模\">季节性建模</h3><p>Prophet 用低阶傅里叶级数拟合季节成分：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><mi>P</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><mi>P</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s(t) = \\sum_{n=1}^{N}\\left(a_n \\cos\\frac{2\\pi nt}{P} + b_n \\sin\\frac{2\\pi nt}{P}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0954em;vertical-align:-1.2671em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8829em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2671em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">cos</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">sin</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>季节周期</th>\n<th><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>默认阶数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>傅里叶项数</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>年</td>\n<td>365.25</td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>20</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>周</td>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>6</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>8</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>阶数越高，季节模式越灵活但越容易过拟合。通过 <code>seasonality_prior_scale</code> 控制正则化强度。</p>\n<h3 id=\"节假日效应\">节假日效应</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from prophet import Prophet&#10;&#10;holidays = pd.DataFrame({&#10;    &#39;holiday&#39;: &#39;spring_festival&#39;,&#10;    &#39;ds&#39;: pd.to_datetime([&#39;2024-02-10&#39;, &#39;2025-01-29&#39;, &#39;2026-02-17&#39;]),&#10;    &#39;lower_window&#39;: -3,&#10;    &#39;upper_window&#39;: 3,&#10;})&#10;model = Prophet(holidays=holidays)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prophet </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Prophet</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">holidays </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pd.DataFrame({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'holiday'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'spring_festival'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'ds'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: pd.to_datetime([</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2024-02-10'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2025-01-29'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2026-02-17'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'lower_window'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'upper_window'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Prophet(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">holidays</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">holidays)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>每个节假日在其窗口内贡献一个独立的效应大小，同样受 Laplace 先验正则化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"prophet-的参数调优\">Prophet 的参数调优</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[选择趋势模型] --&gt; B{是否有容量上限}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C[growth=&#39;logistic&#39; + cap]&#10;    B --&gt;|否| D[growth=&#39;linear&#39;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[调整 changepoint_prior_scale]&#10;    E --&gt;|过拟合| F[减小: 0.001-0.01]&#10;    E --&gt;|欠拟合| G[增大: 0.1-0.5]&#10;    C --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; H[调整季节性阶数和先验]&#10;    H --&gt; I[添加节假日/回归项]&#10;    I --&gt; J[交叉验证评估]&#10;    J --&gt;|不满意| E&#10;    J --&gt;|满意| K[最终模型]\">flowchart TD\n    A[选择趋势模型] --&gt; B{是否有容量上限}\n    B --&gt;|是| C[growth='logistic' + cap]\n    B --&gt;|否| D[growth='linear']\n    D --&gt; E[调整 changepoint_prior_scale]\n    E --&gt;|过拟合| F[减小: 0.001-0.01]\n    E --&gt;|欠拟合| G[增大: 0.1-0.5]\n    C --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; H[调整季节性阶数和先验]\n    H --&gt; I[添加节假日/回归项]\n    I --&gt; J[交叉验证评估]\n    J --&gt;|不满意| E\n    J --&gt;|满意| K[最终模型]</pre><p><strong>关键超参数</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>默认值</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>调优方向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>changepoint_prior_scale</code></td>\n<td>0.05</td>\n<td>趋势灵活性</td>\n<td>增大→更灵活</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>seasonality_prior_scale</code></td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>季节振幅正则化</td>\n<td>减小→更平滑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>holidays_prior_scale</code></td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>节假日效应强度</td>\n<td>减小→效应更弱</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>changepoint_range</code></td>\n<td>0.8</td>\n<td>在前 80% 数据中搜索变点</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>n_changepoints</code></td>\n<td>25</td>\n<td>候选变点数量</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Prophet 内置的时间序列交叉验证：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from prophet.diagnostics import cross_validation, performance_metrics&#10;&#10;cv_results = cross_validation(model, initial=&#39;730 days&#39;, period=&#39;90 days&#39;, horizon=&#39;365 days&#39;)&#10;metrics = performance_metrics(cv_results)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prophet.diagnostics </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cross_validation, performance_metrics</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">cv_results </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cross_validation(model, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">initial</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'730 days'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">period</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'90 days'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">horizon</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'365 days'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">metrics </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> performance_metrics(cv_results)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"prophet-的版本现状-2026\">Prophet 的版本现状（2026）</h2><p>Prophet 当前稳定版本为 1.3.0（2026 年 3 月更新），核心维护者已将重心转向 Nixtla 的 TimeGPT 和 StatsForecast 生态。Prophet 仍在维护但不再有重大功能更新——对新项目，Nixtla 建议将 Prophet 视为基线之一而非唯一选项。</p>\n<h2 id=\"nixtla-自动化预测生态\">Nixtla 自动化预测生态</h2><p>Nixtla 围绕统一的长格式接口（<code>unique_id</code> / <code>ds</code> / <code>y</code>）构建了覆盖全方法谱的预测栈：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>库</th>\n<th>定位</th>\n<th>核心模型</th>\n<th>性能特征</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>StatsForecast</strong></td>\n<td>统计基线</td>\n<td>AutoARIMA, AutoETS, AutoTheta, MSTL, CES</td>\n<td>Rust/Cython 编译，比 statsmodels 快 4–500x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>NeuralForecast</strong></td>\n<td>深度学习</td>\n<td>N-BEATS, N-HiTS, PatchTST, TFT, iTransformer</td>\n<td>PyTorch Lightning 支撑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>MLForecast</strong></td>\n<td>机器学习</td>\n<td>LightGBM, XGBoost + 滞后/滚动特征</td>\n<td>自动特征工程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>TimeGPT</strong></td>\n<td>基础模型</td>\n<td>TimeGPT-1（API 调用）</td>\n<td>零样本，无需训练</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>统一工作流</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from statsforecast import StatsForecast&#10;from statsforecast.models import AutoARIMA, AutoETS, MSTL, AutoTheta&#10;&#10;sf = StatsForecast(&#10;    models=[AutoARIMA(season_length=7), AutoETS(season_length=7),&#10;            MSTL(season_length=[7, 365]), AutoTheta(season_length=7)],&#10;    freq=&#39;D&#39;, n_jobs=-1&#10;)&#10;# 训练 + 预测&#10;forecast = sf.forecast(df=df, h=30, level=[90, 95])&#10;# 交叉验证&#10;cv = sf.cross_validation(df=df, h=14, step_size=7, n_windows=5)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> statsforecast </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> StatsForecast</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> statsforecast.models </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AutoARIMA, AutoETS, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">MSTL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, AutoTheta</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">sf </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> StatsForecast(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    models</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[AutoARIMA(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">season_length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), AutoETS(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">season_length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            MSTL(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">season_length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">365</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]), AutoTheta(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">season_length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    freq</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'D'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n_jobs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 训练 + 预测</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">forecast </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sf.forecast(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">df</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">df, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">h</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">level</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">90</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">95</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 交叉验证</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">cv </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sf.cross_validation(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">df</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">df, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">h</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">step_size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n_windows</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>StatsForecast 的 AutoARIMA 在 M4 基准上达到 20x 加速（相对 pmdarima），在 Ray 集群上 30 分钟内处理 100 万条序列。</p>\n<h2 id=\"自动化预测管线设计\">自动化预测管线设计</h2><p>完整的生产级预测管线通常采用<strong>模型选举</strong>策略：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>数据预处理</strong>：统一频率、填充缺失值、异常值标记</li>\n<li><strong>多模型训练</strong>：StatsForecast（统计）+ MLForecast（ML）+ NeuralForecast（DL）</li>\n<li><strong>交叉验证</strong>：滚动窗口评估每个模型在每条序列上的表现</li>\n<li><strong>最优选择</strong>：按序列选最佳模型（model selection per series）</li>\n<li><strong>概率预测</strong>：输出点预测 + 分位数区间</li>\n<li><strong>监控与回退</strong>：预测漂移检测 → 自动重训</li>\n</ol>\n<p>关于深度学习预测器的具体架构（N-BEATS、PatchTST、Transformer 等），见 <a href=\"deep-learning-forecasting\">深度学习预测模型</a>；关于如何比较不同模型的预测精度，见 <a href=\"../practice/forecast-evaluation-metrics\">预测评估与误差度量</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Prophet 降低了预测的技术门槛，但其真正遗产是&quot;可分解模型 + 分析师可调参数&quot;的设计理念。2026 年的 Nixtla 生态将这一理念工业化——StatsForecast 提供编译级速度的统计基线，NeuralForecast 和 MLForecast 覆盖非线性场景，TimeGPT 实现零样本预测。生产级管线的最佳实践是多方法竞争、按序列选优、滚动监控——而非押注单一模型。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Prophet 与自动化预测","id":"prophet-与自动化预测"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Prophet 模型结构","id":"prophet-模型结构"},{"level":3,"text":"趋势模型","id":"趋势模型"},{"level":3,"text":"季节性建模","id":"季节性建模"},{"level":3,"text":"节假日效应","id":"节假日效应"},{"level":2,"text":"Prophet 的参数调优","id":"prophet-的参数调优"},{"level":2,"text":"Prophet 的版本现状（2026）","id":"prophet-的版本现状-2026"},{"level":2,"text":"Nixtla 自动化预测生态","id":"nixtla-自动化预测生态"},{"level":2,"text":"自动化预测管线设计","id":"自动化预测管线设计"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"GARCH 与波动率建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/time-series-analysis/classical-models/garch-volatility"},"next":{"title":"深度学习预测模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/time-series-analysis/modern-methods/deep-learning-forecasting"}}